Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: E.I.S CYBERCORE <noreply@eis-cybercore.example>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, g++, pkg-config,
               qt6-base-dev, libarchive-dev, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ezshelbyx/eis-extractor

Package: eis-extractor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, 7zip
Recommends: xorriso, udisks2
Description: E.I.S ARCHIVE archive, disc image and password manager
 Native Linux application for creating and extracting archives, inspecting
 and mounting ISO/UDF images, verifying SHA-256/SHA-512/SHA-1/MD5 checksums,
 and storing credentials in an Argon2id + AES-256-GCM encrypted vault.
 .
 7-Zip enables 7Z, RAR and encrypted ZIP support. xorriso enables ISO
 creation. udisks2 enables read-only ISO mounting through polkit.
